The MIT license below covers the source code: the Rust crates, the
Godot project scripts, the tools, and the prose in this repository.

It does not cover the pictures. That includes godot/assets/ and
docs/screenshots/. Those files are not offered for reuse. No separate
art license is granted.

The five deck props (barrel, bollard, cart, crate, and torch) were
vendored as Blender EEVEE plates. The record does not name who made
the meshes, or under what terms. The three quay flags were painted on
a local ComfyUI setup and retoned with a fixed color map. Account
terms at a generator bind the account that made a file. They are not
a license for anyone else to take the pictures.

